[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7620.149, "timestamp": "02:07:00", "text": "とても楽しかったです。期末試験は楽しい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7627.75, "timestamp": "02:07:07", "text": "もうあのゲームはできない。私のPC"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7631.43, "timestamp": "02:07:11", "text": "対処できない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7635.03, "timestamp": "02:07:15", "text": "残念なことですが、私のPCでは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7642.87, "timestamp": "02:07:22", "text": "コピー。ここに置いてください。でも、良いゲームだよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7645.03, "timestamp": "02:07:25", "text": "楽しかったです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7647.99, "timestamp": "02:07:27", "text": "一瞬一瞬を楽しんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7651.27, "timestamp": "02:07:31", "text": "最初にプレイしたのは2023年でした。[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7653.669, "timestamp": "02:07:33", "text": "ここから先はすべてが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7657.683, "timestamp": "02:07:37", "text": "2023年とか、私たちは年だから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7660.069, "timestamp": "02:07:40", "text": "[鼻を鳴らす] 2023年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7664.39, "timestamp": "02:07:44", "text": "あの時。再生を一時停止する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7666.31, "timestamp": "02:07:46", "text": "ダウンロードしてください。 [咳払い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.91, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "私たちは昔のストリームに戻ります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.75, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "保存する"}]